  source: "\u25C7 Hareket    \u25C7 Yetenek hedefi\n\u25A7 Robot bu kareyi vuracak\n?
    Yalan olabilir    \u2299 Robot uyanacak\n\u2197 Ate\u015F \xB7 yak\u0131n \xB7
    onar\u0131m    \u25A1 S\u0131ra bayra\u011F\u0131\n\u2713 Tarand\u0131, kesin   
    \u2B21 Z\u0131rh: hasar i\u015Flemez"
